      "title": {
        "en": "Sticky-window context",
        "zh": "便签窗口上下文"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Replaces the summarizing context compactor with a handoff note the model writes itself and a fresh window that keeps only the system prompt, the note, and the current turn.",
